  "nativeAdaptations": [
    "String identities map the fixed app-owned Plan objects; renderers receive current values and option metadata.",
    "UnselectedValue explicitly maps the fixed null item, preserving ordinary empty-string identities.",
    "MyGo native listbox focus/Tab order and retained Overlay replace DOM FocusManager/portals.",
    "The native one-DIP border participates in layout, unlike the source outer CSS ring; measured available content includes both edges.",
    "InputText supports layout/IME committed text; the source JS typeahead is key-event based. Actual platform IME candidate windows/cancellation are not claimed.",
    "Styled SelectRoot stays in the current window; existing desktop.Select remains an independent-window convenience and NativeSelect keeps its OS menu.",
    "No generic Base form validation, arbitrary item object equality, browser autofill engine, virtualized grid or unused primitive options are claimed."
  ]
}
